Subject: [PATCH 323/333] [ae-patch] Fix the Voice mode second fix-check
 findings: slow first mic start, multi-pick done sentence

The backstop for a mic start that reports nothing fired at 5 s, but the first server take cold-loads the speech model for about 40 s. A healthy first start would have been cancelled and Voice mode would have ended on "Mic unavailable". The backstop is now a named 60 s constant, and the speaker keeps saying "Starting the mic" while it waits.

A multi-select sentence such as "one and three, I'm done" dropped the second pick, because the whole remainder was used whenever it matched anything at all. Both the whole and the trimmed remainder are now tried and the one with more picks wins, the whole one on a tie, so "merge it done" still picks "Merge it".

A mic start that takes the Web Speech path no longer leaves the controller's start flag set, and a stop during such a start no longer leaves a cancel flag that nothing clears.
